%% Hotline Intake Modal — Interaction
%% Page: docs/D-UX-Design/hotline-intake-modal.md
%% Three outcomes branch from Call-outcome select.
%% Submit POSTs /api/events with hotline reporter-badge; T1 default.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Operator as Operator (Priya)
    participant Dash as OperatorDashboard
    participant Modal as HotlineIntakeModal
    participant Val as Zod Schema
    participant API as POST /api/events
    participant Chain as Chain
    participant Toast as ToastProvider

    Operator->>Dash: Click "Log hotline call" (secondary, Phone icon)
    Dash->>Modal: Open (mount, focus first field, scroll-lock body)
    Modal-->>Operator: aria-modal=true, Esc bound

    Operator->>Modal: Fill caller name + phone
    Operator->>Modal: Accept call time default (now)
    Operator->>Modal: Type description (20–500)
    Operator->>Modal: Type location hint (5–200)
    Operator->>Modal: Pick call outcome

    alt outcome = reported_incident
        Operator->>Modal: Click Submit
        Modal->>Val: parse(form)
        Val-->>Modal: ok
        Modal->>API: POST /api/events { ...,<br/>reporter_badge: hotline,<br/>trust_band: T1 }
        API->>Chain: append IncidentCreated event
        Chain-->>API: 201, block_hash
        API-->>Modal: ok
        Modal->>Toast: success "Hotline report filed"
        Modal->>Dash: close + refresh inbox
    else outcome = no_incident
        Operator->>Modal: Click Submit (label: Log call only)
        Modal->>API: POST /api/events { kind: call_log,<br/>outcome: no_incident }
        API-->>Modal: 201
        Modal->>Toast: success "Call logged"
    else outcome = wrong_number
        Operator->>Modal: Click Submit (label: Log call only)
        Modal->>API: POST /api/events { kind: call_log,<br/>outcome: wrong_number }
        API-->>Modal: 201
        Modal->>Toast: success "Call logged"
    end

    alt User presses Esc or Cancel with dirty fields
        Operator->>Modal: Esc / Cancel
        Modal->>Operator: Confirm dialog "Discard changes?"
        alt Confirm
            Modal->>Dash: close, no submit
        else Keep editing
            Modal-->>Operator: focus returns to first invalid field
        end
    end

    Note over Modal,API: All outcomes set reporter_badge=hotline.<br/>Only reported_incident creates a new incident.
